videovigilance
==============

The videovigilance module of the Tryton application platform.

Installing
----------

See INSTALL

Detection service
-----------------

The detection service sends events, heartbeats and video to Tryton through HTTP routes
authenticated with a key of the *Video Surveillance: Detection Service* user application. See
doc/service_api.md.

Languages
---------

Tryton interface strings use English source text, with Catalan and Spanish translations in
locale/ca.po and locale/es.po. The notices web app is displayed in Spanish.

Access
------

The module does not put any user in its groups, so after installing it nobody sees its menu
or can use the web app until an administrator adds the users to *Videovigilància:
administració* (everything, including the movement of the cameras and the alarm switch) or to
*Videovigilància: consulta* (read only).

